  # Recognition cue for unit-conversion questions (issue #1176) — one of these
  # surfaces plus a number and two known units is a conversion request. Common
  # words such as "in" or "to" only open the gate; the unit pair decides.
  unit_conversion_question
    defined-by unit
    role unit_conversion_question
    lexeme en "how many" "how much" convert in to
    lexeme ru сколько переведи конвертируй в
    lexeme hi कितने बदलें में
    lexeme zh 多少 转换 换算 为
    lexeme es cuántos cuántas cuánto convierte convertir en a
